; M1e S1e.2.1 — `CO-H2` route 3 of 4: the plain qualified import, and the
; route the finding was reported on.
;
; `qualify()`'s own doc comment states the intent this used to violate — a
; module illegally defining a reserved name must *keep* it so the loader
; rejects it, never be silently renamed. Until S1e.2.1 this file loaded with
; exit 0 and carried a macro named `reserved_open_direct.open`.
(import reserved_open_direct)
